CPEDAL 1
NAME "Woolly Mammoth Reference Draft"

# CircuitPedal V0.7 reference reconstruction of the common two-2N3904
# Woolly Mammoth schematic. The topology/component values are intended for
# engineering comparison and live testing. The compact 2N3904 model is not yet
# a manufacturer-specific Gummel-Poon/SPICE model, so this file must not be
# treated as a component-accurate clone until measured/SPICE validation is done.

V VCCSRC VCC 0 9
AUDIO GUITAR INPUT 0 0.20
R R_INPUT_PULLDOWN INPUT 0 1M

# Q1 input stage
C C1 INPUT B1 220n
C C2 B1 0 10n
Q Q1 C1_NODE B1 0 2N3904

# Q1 collector directly drives Q2 base.
R R3 VCC C1_NODE 51k
Q Q2 C2_NODE C1_NODE E2 2N3904
R R4 VCC C2_NODE 20k
R R1 E2 0 2k2

# WOOL: variable AC bypass of the Q2 emitter resistor. The node order is
# chosen so a higher GUI value means more Wool, matching clockwise behaviour:
# at 100% the 100u capacitor is effectively taken directly to ground.
C C6 E2 WOOL_TOP 100u
POT WOOL 0 0 WOOL_TOP 2k LIN 0.75

# PINCH: 100k fixed feedback plus a 0..500k rheostat from Q2 emitter
# back to Q1 base.
R R2 B1 PINCH_FIXED 100k
POT PINCH PINCH_FIXED E2 E2 500k LIN 0.35

# Passive tilt EQ and level network.
C C5 C2_NODE TONE_SRC 100u
C C3 TONE_SRC HIGH_PRE 10n
R R5 HIGH_PRE EQ_HIGH 10k
R R6 TONE_SRC EQ_LOW 4k99
C C4 EQ_LOW 0 220n
POT EQ EQ_LOW TONE_OUT EQ_HIGH 10k LIN 0.50
POT OUTPUT 0 OUT TONE_OUT 10k LIN 0.70

OUTPUT OUT 1
